#. module: l10n_kh
# Auto-completed for GlobalCloud GPC zh_CN coverage.
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_kh.demo_company_kh
msgid ""
"Certain countries apply withholding at source on the amount of invoices, in "
"accordance with their internal legislation. Any withholding at source will "
"be paid by the client to the tax authorities. Under no circumstances can KH "
"Company become involved in costs related to a country's legislation. The "
"amount of the invoice will therefore be due to KH Company in its entirety "
"and does not include any costs relating to the legislation of the country in"
" which the client is located."
msgstr ""
"Certain countries apply withholding at source on the 金额 of 发票, in accordance"
" with their internal legislation. Any withholding at source will be paid by "
"the client to the 税 authorities. Under 否 circumstances can KH 公司 become "
"involved in costs 相关 to a country's legislation. The 金额 of the 发票 will "
"therefore be due to KH 公司 in its entirety and does not include any costs "
"relating to the legislation of the 国家/地区 in which the client is located."

