"indicated on either the 发票 or the 订单. In the 活动 of non-payment by the 到期日, "
"KH 公司 reserves the right to 请求 a fixed interest 付款 amounting to 10% of the "
"sum remaining due. KH 公司 will be authorized to suspend any provision of "
"services without prior 警告 in the 活动 of late 付款."

